{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2022-10-19 16:46:00', 'title': 'HP ANNOUNCES COMMENCEMENT OF CHANGE OF CONTROL OFFER FOR 4.750% NOTES DUE 2029', 'text': 'PALO ALTO, CALIF., OCT. 19, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HP INC. (NYSE: HPQ) (“HP” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT COMMENCED A CHANGE OF CONTROL REPURCHASE OFFER TO HOLDERS (THE\xa0“HOLDERS”) FOR ANY AND ALL OUTSTANDING 4.750% NOTES DUE 2029 (THE “NOTES”) OF THE COMPANY FOR CASH (SUCH OFFER TO PURCHASE, THE “POST-ACQUISITION CHANGE OF CONTROL REPURCHASE OFFER”).'}